<Base title="Technology research | HourlyTechs" description="A Flagstaff-based research initiative examining how technology affects Arizona households, businesses and communities."><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">HourlyTechs · Arizona</p><h1>Understanding technology through data.</h1><p class="lead">A Flagstaff-based research initiative examining how technology affects Arizona households, businesses and communities.</p></div><div class="visual"><p class="visual-foot">HOURLYTECHS / RESEARCH</p><div class="visual-title">Technology research</div><p>Research program in development. No studies have been published yet.</p></div></div></section><section class="block"><div class="wrap"><h2>Our research agenda</h2><div class="service-grid"><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/shield-alert.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>Cybercrime & digital safety</h3><p>Examine patterns in reported fraud, online crime and consumer exposure to digital risks.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/wifi.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>Internet access</h3><p>Explore connectivity, affordability and differences in access across urban and rural communities.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/brain.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>AI adoption</h3><p>Track how households and businesses adopt emerging tools and where barriers remain.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/briefcase-business.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>Small business technology</h3><p>Investigate technology use, digital capability and challenges facing smaller organizations.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/graduation-cap.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>Digital skills</h3><p>Explore available evidence about technology literacy and barriers to participation.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/chart-no-axes-combined.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>Arizona in context</h3><p>Compare Arizona with national trends when comparable data is available.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="block pricing"><div class="wrap"><h2>Editorial standards</h2><div class="service-grid"><article class="service"><h3>Traceable sources</h3><p>Identify datasets, dates, definitions and links to original sources where available.</p></article><article class="service"><h3>Transparent methods</h3><p>Explain calculations, denominators and meaningful limitations so readers can evaluate findings.</p></article><article class="service"><h3>Careful interpretation</h3><p>Distinguish measured findings from hypotheses, commentary and causal claims.</p></article></div><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/#pricing">View service pricing</a><a class="plain" href="/#services">Explore services</a></div></div></section></Base>